// IpcOpenEventHandle Opens an interprocess event handles.
//
// Opens an interprocess event handle exported from another process with [Event.IpcGetEventHandle]. The returned
// [Event] behaves like a locally created event with the EventDisableTiming flag specified. This event
// need be freed with [Event.Destroy]. Operations on the imported event after the exported event has been freed
